{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人蕭正楠、連詩雅及應屆港姐冠軍袁絲珩今日（27日）為主持的全新節目《星廚》進行海選，在一眾參賽藝人中挑選「星級」廚師。</p><p>問到三人廚藝是否了得？</p><p>蕭正楠謙稱自己屬「放得入口」形，太太黃翠如愛吃他煮的粉絲；</p><p>連詩雅稱最自豪是「花膠炆冬菇」，至於袁絲</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:43:51.740008+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T11:03:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T11:37:12.604057+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:37:12.604057+00:00","content_hash":"f80ec3c09a2b9fe282593995c736002e046bec63b982d8b3c76b85a726373a0f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}